    # game/strings/Books.rpy:75
    old "{size=+4}                     Chapter nine\n               The Lovers' Embrace{/size}{size=-2}\n\n    Sir Teningheart, still wounded from the night's battle, awoke in a panic as he sprung forward. He wheezed in pain as those around him gently pushed him back down onto the bed.\n — Sir Teningheart, please! You must rest my lord!\n — Urghh!\nSir Teningheart inspected the bandages around his body as he thought back to his duel with Veringuard. He had always thought himself invincible on the field of battle... But Veringuard-\n    The door burst open as Ophelia, flushed red and wide-eyed, hurried over towards Teningheart.\n — You're alive!\nHe winced in pain as his beloved wrapped her arms around him and hugged tightly.\n — O-Ophelia...                              \n    Wiping her tears, Ophelia loosened her tight, desperate hold.\n — I heard you were dead, I'd heard-\n — It's alright, Ophelia... these wounds will heal.\n — Why... Why you damn fool!\n — If it bought peace, if it ended this damn war...\n — I would have have married him!\n — Ophelia...\nTeningheart reached out to tenderly take a hold of her hands.\n — I fought {color=#fff185}so that thine could stay clean{/color}, stay pure of such terrible things such as marrying that beast.\n — But... If he sees you again at the next battle-\n — Then I shall return the favor for his grievous wound on myself.{/size}"
    new "{size=+4}                     第九章\n               恋人的拥抱{/size}{size=-2}\n\n    特宁哈特爵士，仍带着夜战的伤痛，猛地惊醒，惊慌地坐起身来。他在痛苦中喘息，周围的人们轻轻将他按回床上。\n — 特宁哈特爵士，求您了！您必须休息，大人！\n — 呃啊！\n特宁哈特爵士检查着身上的绷带，回想起与维林 Guard 的决斗。他一直以为自己战场上无敌……但维林 Guard-\n    门猛地打开，奥菲莉亚满脸通红，睁大眼睛，急忙冲向特宁哈特。\n — 你还活着！\n当心爱的人双臂环抱住他，紧紧拥抱时，他因疼痛而畏缩。\n — 奥-奥菲莉亚……                              \n    奥菲莉亚擦去眼泪，松开了她紧握的、绝望的拥抱。\n — 我听说你死了，我听说-\n — 没事的，奥菲莉亚……这些伤会愈合的。\n — 为什么……你这个该死的傻瓜！\n — 如果这能换来和平，如果这能结束这场该死的战争……\n — 我本来会嫁给他的！\n — 奥菲莉亚……\n特宁哈特伸出手，温柔地握住她的双手。\n — 我战斗{color=#fff185}是为了让你保持纯洁{/color}，远离诸如嫁给那头野兽之类的可怕事情。\n — 但是……如果他在下一场战斗中再见到你-\n — 那我必将回报他给我留下的重伤。{/size}"# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-10-02 20:34

translate zh strings:

    # game/strings/Books.rpy:47
    old "    Little is remembered of the ancient Onji culture, the predecessors to many of the modern day races of Mirnos. What records remain, describe them as rulling a vast empire across Mirnos, with red hot skin. It is said, their people held advancing smithing techniques, allowing them to craft powerful weapons and armor that enabled them to rule over the lands for some few thousand years as it's master.\n\n    Many of the records around their people, their culture and society, and the full bredth of history has been lost to time. It appears that a series of cataclysmic events eventually led to the downfall of the Onji, some suggest growing threats from foreign powers over their outermost territories caused upheaval, other scholars suggest a series of famine and possible droughts were to blame. Given most of the records around the Onji appear to have been {i}actively destroyed,{/i} we can only deduce that the Onji themselves were, most likely, overthrown in some kind of large scale rebellion.\n\n    While few scant records survived this purge, a scroll uncovered and wrote in ancient Alderian made reference to the Onji's youngest prince, Thallan of the royal house of Summermore. While the scroll did not elaborate on the nature of his crimes, it made reference to how his {i}wicked and cruel ways were at last, at an end.{/i} The documents appears to be dated closely to around estimates scholars give around the total collapse of the Onji society."
    new "关于古代昂吉文明的记载寥寥无几，他们是米诺斯许多现代种族的先驱。残存的记录描述他们统治着一个横跨米诺斯的庞大帝国，族人拥有炽热的红色皮肤。据说，他们掌握了先进的锻造技术，能够打造强大的武器和盔甲，这使他们得以作为这片土地的主宰统治了数千年。\n\n关于昂吉民族、其文化社会以及完整历史的大部分记录都已湮没在时光中。一系列灾难性事件最终导致了昂吉的衰落，有学者认为是来自外部势力对其边远领土日益增长的威胁引发了动荡，也有学者归咎于一系列饥荒和可能的干旱。鉴于关于昂吉的大部分记录似乎都遭到了{i}有意的销毁，{/i}我们只能推断，昂吉人自己很可能是在某种大规模叛乱中被推翻了。\n\n虽然这次清洗中幸存的记录极少，但一份以古奥尔德雷语书写并出土的卷轴提到了昂吉最年幼的王子，来自夏盛王室的萨兰。尽管卷轴没有详述他罪行的性质，但提及了他的{i}邪恶与残暴行径终于走到了尽头。{/i}这份文件的年代似乎与学者们估算的昂吉社会彻底崩溃的时间点非常接近。"

